This looks odd:

> A1+A2+A3 =~ FA
> B1+B2+B3 =~ FB
> C1+C2+C3 =~ FC
> D1+D2+D3 =~ FD
> E1+E2+E3 =~ FE
> F1+F2+F3 =~ FF
> FA+FB+FC=~PC1
> FD+FE+FF =~ PC2
> PC1+PC2 =~ CC
> CC =~ obCC

According to your path diagram, A-F is regressed on the a1-f3 factors;
they are not 'second' order factors. So your syntax should be:

FA ~ A1 + A2 + A3
FB ~ B1 + B2 + B3
...
PC1 ~ FA + FB + FC
PC2 ~ FD + FE + FF
CC ~ PC1 + PC2
obCC ~ CC

Yves.

