The paradox is this: your figure does not correspond with the data that
you have generated. In your figure, FA FB FC etc are NOT second-order
factors because they have arrows pointing towards them.

While in your data, FA, FB, etc do not exist.

You can not have endogenous latent variables that do not have indicators.

Yves.

